ating breakfast with him?\n\nBased on the above:\n\n- **One person** — the older man in the white cap — is consistently seated next to the American man and is actively eating with him (frames 13, 17, 18, 27, 28, 29, 30).\n- Other people are eating nearby (frames 21–24), but not necessarily “with” him at the same immediate eating space.\n- **However**, since **there is no confirmation this is breakfast** (criteria 3 and 6 fail), we **cannot confirm anyone is having *breakfast* with him**.\n\n---\n\n## ✅ VERDICT:\n\nThe answer **'0' is correct**.\n\nWhile people are eating *with* the American man, **there is no visual evidence that the meal is breakfast**. Without confirmation of breakfast (food type, time of day, context), we cannot count anyone as having *breakfast* with him.\n\n> **Answer: 0** — Correct."}, {'batch_start': 60, 'batch_end': 90, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5020.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5021.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5022.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5023.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5024.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5025.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5026.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5027.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5028.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5029.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5030.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5031.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5032.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5033.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/fram