gether.\n\n---\n\n### ✅ **Conclusion: The answer '0' is CORRECT.**\n\nDespite the presence of the American man and others eating with him, **the meal is not breakfast**, so the count of people having breakfast with him (excluding himself) is **zero**.\n\n---  \n**Answer: 0** ✅"}, {'batch_start': 90, 'batch_end': 120, 'image_paths': ['/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5050.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5051.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5052.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5053.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5054.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5055.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5056.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5057.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5058.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5059.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5060.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5061.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5062.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5063.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5064.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5065.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5066.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5067.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5068.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5069.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5070.jpg', '/mnt/ssd/data/lvbench/videos_processed/wNCPgIVz15c/frames/frame_5071